sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Record discipline and behaviour
    %% Stories: 33, 35, 36
    %% Description: A teacher records disciplinary actions and behaviour marks for a student, and the mentor is notified when a student is sent out.
    actor TP as Teacher (person)
    participant TE as Teacher
    participant DA as DisciplinaryAction
    participant ST as Student
    participant MN as Mentor
    participant BE as Behavior

    %% covers 35
    TP->>TE: record disciplinary action
    TE->>DA: disciplinary action
    DA->>ST: student concerned
    %% covers 33
    ST->>MN: notify mentor when sent out
    %% covers 36
    TP->>TE: record behaviour for the period
    TE->>BE: behaviour mark
    BE->>ST: student concerned
